### Room Booking API - manual test requests
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client),
### start the server (uvicorn main:app --reload), then click "Send Request"
### above each request. Run them top to bottom.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
# Dates are calculated when the request is sent, so they are always valid
@tomorrow = {{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 1 d}}
@yesterday = {{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" -1 d}}


### 1. List rooms -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms


### 2. SUCCESS: create a booking -> 201 Created
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": 1,
  "booker_name": "Alice",
  "date": "{{tomorrow}}",
  "start_hour": 10,
  "end_hour": 12
}


### 3. List bookings for room 1 tomorrow -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/1/bookings?date={{tomorrow}}


### 4. INVALID INPUT: blank name -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": 1,
  "booker_name": "   ",
  "date": "{{tomorrow}}",
  "start_hour": 13,
  "end_hour": 14
}


### 5. INVALID INPUT: date in the past -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": 1,
  "booker_name": "Alice",
  "date": "{{yesterday}}",
  "start_hour": 13,
  "end_hour": 14
}


### 6. INVALID INPUT: end_hour before start_hour -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": 1,
  "booker_name": "Alice",
  "date": "{{tomorrow}}",
  "start_hour": 15,
  "end_hour": 14
}


### 7. INVALID INPUT: outside opening hours (8-22) -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": 1,
  "booker_name": "Alice",
  "date": "{{tomorrow}}",
  "start_hour": 6,
  "end_hour": 9
}


### 8. INVALID INPUT: bad date in query string -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/1/bookings?date=2030-13-45


### 9. NOT FOUND: booking an unknown room -> 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": 999,
  "booker_name": "Alice",
  "date": "{{tomorrow}}",
  "start_hour": 10,
  "end_hour": 12
}


### 10. NOT FOUND: bookings for an unknown room -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/999/bookings?date={{tomorrow}}


### 11. CONFLICT: overlaps request 2 (10-12) -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": 1,
  "booker_name": "Bob",
  "date": "{{tomorrow}}",
  "start_hour": 11,
  "end_hour": 13
}


### 12. ADJACENT is allowed: 12-14 right after 10-12 -> 201
# @name adjacentBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "room_id": 1,
  "booker_name": "Bob",
  "date": "{{tomorrow}}",
  "start_hour": 12,
  "end_hour": 14
}


### 13. DELETE: cancel the booking from request 2 -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}


### 14. DELETE again: it no longer exists -> 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}


### 15. Clean up: cancel the adjacent booking from request 12 -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{adjacentBooking.response.body.$.id}}
